WEBVTT

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.000
KT: God.

00:03:06.976 --> 00:03:07.976
KB: Are you ready?

00:03:09.535 --> 00:03:11.976
Where is it? There's no way --

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.000
KT: (Beep)

00:03:17.222 --> 00:03:18.750
KT: Oh, my God!

00:03:18.774 --> 00:03:19.976
KB: Don't say anything,

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.572
I'm trying to see through your eyes.
I can't see.

00:03:22.596 --> 00:03:24.263
KT: There's a wall, there's a wall.

00:03:24.287 --> 00:03:26.263
KB: Look at the road, look at the road.

00:03:26.287 --> 00:03:27.976
KT: OK, OK, OK. Oh, my God!

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.976
KB: Now, anything coming at all?
KT: No.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.039
KB: Sure there's not?